.git
.github
.gitignore
*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE
helm/
grafana/
web/node_modules
web/dist

# Keep the API/web image build context small. The ~260MB Windows Docker build
# context was canceling mid-transfer ("error from sender: context canceled").
# None of these are needed by any build stage: go-builder's `COPY . .` only
# compiles Go sources + migrations, and the only docs artifact used is
# docs/public/openapi.yaml (kept — only docs/.vitepress + node_modules excluded).
**/node_modules
apps/
scripts/
bin/
backups/
docs/.vitepress
